OL,9,BRussia retrieves burning cargo ship    
OL,10,Bfrom Gulf of Finland after drone strike
OL,11,GThe Sparta II ship was sailing to      
OL,12,GRussia's Baltic exclave of Kaliningrad 
OL,13,Gwhen it was struck by a drone, caught  
OL,14,Gfire, and drifted into Finland's       
OL,15,Gterritorial waters.                    
