OL,17,BFinland struggles to keep kids fit     
OL,18,GOne in four boys and nearly one in five
OL,19,Ggirls aged 2 to 16 are overweight or   
OL,20,Gobese, according to the Finnish public 
OL,21,Ghealth authority THL.                  
